---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Contact CrackStreams – Questions, Feedback & Support</title>
<meta name="description" content="Reach CrackStreams with general inquiries, website feedback, suggestions, or questions concerning information and features available on the site." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>

  <header class="top-header">
    <a href="/" class="top-header-title">CrackStreams</a>
  </header>
<main class="page-container static-content-page">

  <div class="static-content-card">

    <h1 class="static-page-title">Get in Touch With CrackStreams</h1>

    <p class="static-page-subtitle">
      Need to reach out? CrackStreams is open to general inquiries, constructive suggestions, website feedback, and other relevant messages from visitors.
    </p>

    <section class="static-section">

      <h2>Contact Our Team</h2>

      <p>
        For questions concerning the website, recommendations for improvements, or other general matters involving CrackStreams, you can contact us by email. Please explain your request clearly and include the relevant details so your message can be reviewed with better context.
      </p>

      <p class="contact-email-box">
        Email: <strong>crackstreams.contact@gmail.com</strong>
      </p>

    </section>

    <section class="static-section">

      <h2>Copyright-Related Requests</h2>

      <p>
        Copyright owners or authorized representatives who have a concern involving material referenced on the website can review our <a href="/dmca" class="inline-link">DMCA Policy</a>. When submitting a request, provide enough information to identify the material and explain the nature of the concern clearly.
      </p>

      <p class="contact-email-box">
        Email: <strong>crackstreams.contact@gmail.com</strong>
      </p>

    </section>

    <section class="static-section">

      <h2>Helpful Information to Include</h2>

      <p>
        When contacting CrackStreams, try to include the subject of your inquiry, relevant page information, and any details needed to understand your message. Clear and specific submissions are easier to review, while response times can vary depending on the type and complexity of the request.
      </p>

    </section>

  </div>

</main>
</body>
</html>